    "name": "Run-Sprint-Parkour!",
    "steam_appid": 3452530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/7093145c4fdd248373708c831e98881c.avif?t=1752168814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>From zero to hero! Run and race to the finish line. Collect coins, diamonds, and cash before time runs out, or compete against your opponents. Embark on a treasure hunt, but stay alert for dangerous creatures and cunning bandits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let your hunger, thirst, or health drop too low! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/d198f2702cfdeee9a1615552e3123f08.avif?t=1752168814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>You can purchase food to survive, backpacks to carry more items, keys to unlock new apartments, vehicles to drive, an axe, as well as a variety of cool and funny cosmetics and outfits! Explore and travel to other maps through the Air Travel Agency to advance your career. Experience the thrill, savor the excitement, and dive into the action and adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/222c246bbe3970fb5d9e8bf3b241755f.avif?t=1752168814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/7093145c4fdd248373708c831e98881c.avif?t=1752168814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>From zero to hero! Run and race to the finish line. Collect coins, diamonds, and cash before time runs out, or compete against your opponents. Embark on a treasure hunt, but stay alert for dangerous creatures and cunning bandits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let your hunger, thirst, or health drop too low! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/d198f2702cfdeee9a1615552e3123f08.avif?t=1752168814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>You can purchase food to survive, backpacks to carry more items, keys to unlock new apartments, vehicles to drive, an axe, as well as a variety of cool and funny cosmetics and outfits! Explore and travel to other maps through the Air Travel Agency to advance your career. Experience the thrill, savor the excitement, and dive into the action and adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452530/extras/222c246bbe3970fb5d9e8bf3b241755f.avif?t=1752168814\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "An action-adventure sports 3D platform survival game. Qualify to join thrilling running competitions, and unleash your unstoppable potential. Put on an unforgettable show and rise to riches\u2014go from zero to hero!",
